/device/name	the preset cuts the name
/device/vendor	the preset has no field for it
/device/osc_prefix	the preset has no field for it: the import builds the prefix from the name of the preset
/device/device_id	the preset has no field for it
/device/rate_limit_hz	the preset has no field for it
/device/_a~1b~0c	the preset has no field for it
/device/_zz	the preset has no field for it
/role_vocabulary	the preset carries controls and SysEx messages only
/programs	the preset carries controls and SysEx messages only
/sysex	the preset carries controls and SysEx messages only
/cc_params/channel	the channel of a preset belongs to its devices, which the export does not describe
/cc_params/entries/0/default	the preset has no field for it
/cc_params/entries/0/channel	the channel of a preset belongs to its devices, which the export does not describe
/cc_params/entries/0/_zz	the preset has no field for it
/cc_params/entries/0/ways/1	a control of the preset sends one message: the cc7 way is written, the nrpn way is not
/cc_params/entries/0/description	the preset has no field for it
/cc_params/entries/0/value_description	the preset has no field for it
/cc_params/entries/0/notes	the preset has no field for it
/cc_params/entries/0/scale	the preset has no field for it
/cc_params/entries/0/ways/0/value_bits	the preset does not say the width of a value: the import reads 7 bits for a CC of one number, 14 for a 14-bit CC, an NRPN or an RPN
/cc_params/entries/1/default	the preset has no field for it
/cc_params/entries/2	the control has no complete MIDI binding to write
/cc_params/entries/2/nrpn_msb	no way of the control says this field (a message not fully known, or the block beside one): it is not written, and no number is added to complete it
/cc_params/entries/3	the control has no complete MIDI binding to write
/cc_params/entries/3/cc_lsb	no way of the control says this field (a message not fully known, or the block beside one): it is not written, and no number is added to complete it
/cc_params/entries/4/ways/0/ctrlIndex	a 14-bit CC of the preset pairs a CC from 0 to 31 with the CC 32 above it
/cc_params/entries/4/ways/0/value_bits	the preset does not say the width of a value: the import reads 7 bits for a CC of one number, 14 for a 14-bit CC, an NRPN or an RPN
/cc_params/entries/4/title	the preset needs a name, cuts it and keeps two names of a group apart: the import reads what is written
/cc_params/entries/5	the preset lays its controls out by group: the import gives this one before one that precedes it
/cc_params/entries/5/also/0/nrpn_msb	no way of the control says this field (a message not fully known, or the block beside one): it is not written, and no number is added to complete it
/cc_params/entries/5/ways/0/value_bits	the preset does not say the width of a value: the import reads 7 bits for a CC of one number, 14 for a 14-bit CC, an NRPN or an RPN
/cc_params/entries/5/_incomplete	the preset has no field for it
/cc_params/entries/6	the preset lays its controls out by group: the import gives this one before one that precedes it
/cc_params/entries/6/values/0/title	the preset needs a name, cuts it and keeps two names of a group apart: the import reads what is written
/cc_params/entries/6/ways/0/value_bits	the preset does not say the width of a value: the import reads 7 bits for a CC of one number, 14 for a 14-bit CC, an NRPN or an RPN
/cc_params/entries/7/ways/0/nrpn_lsb_range	the preset has no field for it
/cc_params/entries/8	the control has no complete MIDI binding to write
/cc_params/_zz	the preset has no field for it
/commands/0/_a~1b~0c	the preset has no field for it
/commands/0/title	the preset needs a name, cuts it and keeps two names of a group apart: the import reads what is written
/commands/1	the preset lays its controls out by group: the import gives this one before one that precedes it
/commands/1	the parameter number a source keeps for this command (parameter_numbers) is not written in the preset
/commands/1/notes	the preset has no field for it
/commands/1/args/0/default	the preset has no field for it
/commands/1/args/0/_zz	the preset has no field for it
/commands/1/_zz	the preset has no field for it
/commands/1/title	the preset needs a name, cuts it and keeps two names of a group apart: the import reads what is written
/commands/2	the preset written gives no control, or no command, back as this one at this place
/commands/2/args/0/name	the command is not written: the preset holds no part of its argument
/commands/2/args/0/type	the command is not written: the preset holds no part of its argument
/commands/2/frame	the preset template written holds fixed bytes between F0 and F7, the argument `value` (u7, or u14 as u14_lsb and u14_msb, nothing added) and checksums: this frame is none such
/triggers	the preset carries controls and SysEx messages only
/_coverage	the preset carries controls and SysEx messages only
/_a~1b~0c	the preset carries controls and SysEx messages only
/_zz	the preset carries controls and SysEx messages only
/sources	the preset has no field for the credit and the licence of its sources
